{"v":1,"book":"Eccl","ch":1,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The words of the Preacher, the son of David, the king in Jerusalem.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Preacher","s":["H6953"],"a":[1]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[3]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Vanity of vanities, says the Preacher; Vanity of vanities; all is vanity.","tok":[{"t":"Vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"vanities","s":["H1892"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Preacher","s":["H6953"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"vanities","s":["H1892"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; all is "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"What advantage does a man have in all his work Which he does under the sun?","tok":[{"t":"What advantage does a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have in all his work Which he does under the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H8121"],"a":[7]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":4,"text":"A generation goes and a generation comes, But the earth stands forever.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"generation","s":["H1755"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"goes","s":["H1980"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and a "},{"t":"generation","s":["H1755"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"comes","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":", But the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":" stands forever."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Also, the sun rises, and the sun sets And hurries to its place where it rises.","tok":[{"t":"Also, the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H8121"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rises","s":["H2224"],"a":[0]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H8121"],"a":[3]},{"t":" sets And hurries to its "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[5]},{"t":" where it rises."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Going to the south, then turning to the north, Turning about continually, the wind goes on; And following its circuits, the wind returns.","tok":[{"t":"Going to the "},{"t":"south","s":["H1864"],"a":[2]},{"t":", then turning to the "},{"t":"north","s":["H6828"],"a":[5]},{"t":", Turning "},{"t":"about","s":["H5437"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"continually","s":["H1980"],"a":[8]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[13]},{"t":" goes on; And following its "},{"t":"circuits","s":["H5439"],"a":[11]},{"t":", the wind returns."}]},{"n":7,"text":"All the rivers run to the sea, Yet the sea is not full; To the place where the rivers run, There they run again.","tok":[{"t":"All the "},{"t":"rivers","s":["H5158"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"run","s":["H1980"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Yet the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is not "},{"t":"full","s":["H4392"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; To the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[9]},{"t":" where the "},{"t":"rivers","s":["H5158"],"a":[10]},{"t":" run, There they run "},{"t":"again","s":["H3212"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"All things are wearisome; No one is able to tell it; The eye is not satisfied with seeing, Nor is the ear filled with hearing.","tok":[{"t":"All "},{"t":"things","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are wearisome; No one is able to tell it; The "},{"t":"eye","s":["H5869"],"a":[9]},{"t":" is not "},{"t":"satisfied","s":["H7646"],"a":[8]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"seeing","s":["H7200"],"a":[10]},{"t":", Nor is the "},{"t":"ear","s":["H0241"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"filled","s":["H4390"],"a":[12]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"hearing","s":["H8085"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"What has been is what will be, And what has been done is what will be done, And there is nothing new under the sun.","tok":[{"t":"What has been is what will be, And what has been "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is what will be "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And there is nothing "},{"t":"new","s":["H2319"],"a":[10]},{"t":" under the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H8121"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Is there anything of which one can say, See, this is new? Already it has been, in the ages that were before us.","tok":[{"t":"Is "},{"t":"there","s":["H3426"],"a":[0]},{"t":" anything of which one can say, "},{"t":"See","s":["H7200"],"a":[3]},{"t":", this is "},{"t":"new","s":["H2319"],"a":[5]},{"t":"? "},{"t":"Already","s":["H3528"],"a":[7]},{"t":" it has been, in the ages that were "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[12]},{"t":" us."}]},{"n":11,"text":"There is no remembrance of those who were before; And also those who will come to be afterward, for them there will be no remembrance With those who come to be after them.","tok":[{"t":"There is no "},{"t":"remembrance","s":["H2146"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of those who were before; And also those who will come to be afterward, for them there will be no "},{"t":"remembrance","s":["H2146"],"a":[9]},{"t":" With those who "},{"t":"come","s":["H0314"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to be "},{"t":"after","s":["H0314"],"a":[12]},{"t":" them."}]},{"n":12,"text":"I, the Preacher, have been king over Israel in Jerusalem.","tok":[{"t":"I, the "},{"t":"Preacher","s":["H6953"],"a":[1]},{"t":", have been "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[3]},{"t":" over "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"And I set my heart to seek and to search out by wisdom all that is done under the heavens. It is grievous travail that God has given to the children of men to travail in.","tok":[{"t":"And I set my "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"seek","s":["H1875"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and to search "},{"t":"out","s":["H8446"],"a":[4]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[5]},{"t":" all that is "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[9]},{"t":" under the "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[11]},{"t":". It is "},{"t":"grievous","s":["H7451"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"travail","s":["H6045"],"a":[13]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[16]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"given","s":["H5414"],"a":[15]},{"t":" to the children of men to travail in."}]},{"n":14,"text":"I have seen all the works that are done under the sun, and indeed, all is vanity and a chasing after wind.","tok":[{"t":"I have "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[0]},{"t":" all the "},{"t":"works","s":["H4639"],"a":[3]},{"t":" that are "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[4]},{"t":" under the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H8121"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and indeed, all is "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and a chasing after wind."}]},{"n":15,"text":"What is crooked cannot be made straight, and what is lacking cannot be counted.","tok":[{"t":"What is "},{"t":"crooked","s":["H5791"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cannot","s":["H3201"],"a":[2]},{"t":" be made "},{"t":"straight","s":["H8626"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and what is lacking "},{"t":"cannot","s":["H3201"],"a":[6]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"counted","s":["H4487"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"I spoke to my own heart, saying, Now I have magnified and increased my wisdom more than all who have been over Jerusalem before me; and my heart has observed in abundance wisdom and knowledge.","tok":[{"t":"I spoke to my own "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Now I have magnified and increased my "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[9]},{"t":" more than all who have been over "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[14]},{"t":" me; and my "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[17]},{"t":" has observed in abundance "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[20]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[21]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"And I set my heart to know wisdom and to know madness and folly; I perceived that this also is a chasing after wind.","tok":[{"t":"And I set my "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and to "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"madness","s":["H1947"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"folly","s":["H5531"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; I "},{"t":"perceived","s":["H3045"],"a":[7]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"this","s":["H1571"],"a":[8]},{"t":" also is a chasing after wind."}]},{"n":18,"text":"For in much wisdom is much vexation, and he who increases knowledge increases sorrow.","tok":[{"t":"For in "},{"t":"much","s":["H7230"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"much","s":["H7230"]},{"t":" vexation, and he who "},{"t":"increases","s":["H3254"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"increases","s":["H3254"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sorrow","s":["H4341"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]}]}
